<title>UK: Ex-dividends take 1.636 points off UK's FTSE index.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends take 1.636 points off UK's FTSE index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>FTSE International Ltd said the following FTSE 100 index stocks will go ex-dividend on Tuesday and the effect will be to take 1.636 points off the index today.</p>
<p>							     DIVIDEND    INDEX</p>
<p>							    (PENCE)     EFFECT</p>
<p>		    COMPANY			     Net   Gross  Gross</p>
<p>	   * ASDA Group				 1.93   2.41   0.413</p>
<p>	   * British Sky Broadcasting Group     3.00   3.75   0.377</p>
<p>	   * Railtrack Group			 13.75  17.19   0.503</p>
<p>	   * Reed International		     8.25  10.31   0.343</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
